WEBVTT

00:03:27.621 --> 00:03:31.079
The question that Franklin's experience
with the blacklist raises is,

00:03:31.079 --> 00:03:32.954
I think central to all progress.

00:03:33.496 --> 00:03:38.121
How can you challenge conventional wisdom
today on how to be a better human?

00:03:38.246 --> 00:03:41.954
We've got Franklin here to answer
that question and so many more.

00:03:42.538 --> 00:03:44.413
This is Franklin Leonard, founder
of The Blacklist.

00:03:45.079 --> 00:03:49.996
The blacklist has gone from being just
a list of the most beloved scripts to

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:52.704
so much more than that. So I'm wondering,
just in your own words,

00:03:52.704 --> 00:03:55.871
how do you now think of it and describe
what the blacklist is?

00:03:55.913 --> 00:03:59.579
Yeah, I mean, I think of our North
Star as being in identifying

00:03:59.579 --> 00:04:02.329
and celebrating great screenwriting
and the people who do it.